<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <LangVersion>11.0</LangVersion>
    <TargetFramework>netstandard2.1</TargetFramework>
    <PackageId>Mythosia.Integrity</PackageId>
    <Title>Mythosia.Integrity</Title>
    <Authors>JJW</Authors>
    <Company>JJW</Company>
    <Product>Mythosia.Integrity</Product>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <Description>CRC and 8-bit checksum calculation, frame encoding, error detection and payload decoding for byte sequences through a common ErrorDetection API.
Supports CRC8 Classic/Maxim, CRC16 Classic/Modbus/CCITT XModem/DNP/CCITT-FALSE/X25, CRC32 Classic, CRC32C (Castagnoli), CRC64/NVME, and XOR/NMEA, modulo-256 and two's-complement checksums.
Includes incremental accumulators and synchronous/asynchronous stream CRC calculation with a reusable 64 KiB buffer. Targets .NET Standard 2.1. See the package README for examples and byte-order behavior.</Description>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>1.3.0
- Add incremental accumulators and synchronous/asynchronous streaming for CRC8, CRC16 and CRC32, with cancellation support and a reusable 64 KiB buffer.
- Add CRC32C (Castagnoli), CRC64/NVME and CRC16 CCITT-FALSE/X25 across calculation, frame, accumulator and stream APIs.
- Preserve all existing public API declarations, optional defaults, calculation results, native digest byte order and legacy DNP representation.
- Validate 175 published fixed answers for the new algorithms within 2,179 Integrity tests, plus independent calculations, partitions, streams and compatibility checks.
- Verify actual NuGet packages, all eight executable README examples, public API and metadata in Windows/Linux Debug/Release CI; publish only the exact package that passes all four configurations.
Full release notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia/blob/master/Mythosia.Integrity/RELEASE_NOTES.md</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageTags>CRC CRC8 CRC8-MAXIM CRC16 Modbus XModem DNP CCITT-FALSE X25 CRC32 CRC32C Castagnoli CRC64 NVME streaming checksum XOR NMEA modulo-256 two's-complement</PackageTags>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia/tree/master/Mythosia.Integrity</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <Version>1.3.0</Version>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>false</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <AssemblyVersion>1.2.0.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>1.3.0.0</FileVersion>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\Mythosia\Mythosia.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Update="README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
    <None Update="RELEASE_NOTES.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
